2. Schemas from Microsoft Open Specifications
===============================================================================

  schemas/ms-extensions/  62 schemas from Appendix A of [MS-PPTX] and [MS-ODRAWXML],
                          extracted from the documentation pages on 2026-11-07

The Open Specifications notice on those pages permits distributing "with or without
modification, any schemas" in an implementation. It also states that Microsoft has
patents that might cover implementations, and points to its patent promises.
That statement is the part of this inventory most in need of review (DEC-07).

The XSD schemas in tools/f4/ (coreProperties.xsd, dublin-core/) are local stubs
written for this project, not copies; see tools/f4/validate.py.

